  "title": "Additional Services and Invoice Generation",
  "language": "python",
  "difficulty": "stretch",
  "estimatedMinutes": 55,
  "instructions": "Extend ticket generation and add invoicing. In `services/ticket_service_impl.py` accept optional additional services (reject unknown ones and ones the vehicle type does not support before assigning a spot). In `services/invoice_service_impl.py` create an invoice at an exit gate (parking fee plus the services' fees, spot becomes AVAILABLE again). Implement the two pricing models in `strategies/weekday_pricing_strategy.py` (10 per started hour) and `strategies/weekend_pricing_strategy.py` (slab pricing per vehicle type; an end hour of `-1` means no upper limit). The factory, controllers and repositories are provided.",
